{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"谱"},0],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"稳定同伦论","text":"稳定同伦论"}}]},4],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"谱 (稳定同伦论)"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>本页面讨论"},{"Local":{"url":"稳定同伦论","text":"稳定同伦论"}},{"Plain":"中的谱. 另一个无关的概念是"},{"Local":{"url":"代数-几何对偶","text":"代数–几何对偶"}},{"Plain":"中的"},{"Local":{"url":"谱(代数)","text":"谱"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>带基点"},{"Local":{"url":"生象","text":"生象"}},{"Plain":" $X,Y$ 之间的<strong>稳定映射空间</strong>\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}_s(X,Y) :=\\operatorname{colim}_k \\operatorname{Hom}(\\Sigma^k X,\\Sigma^k Y)\r\n$$\n具有自然的 "},{"Local":{"url":"E∞-群","text":"$\\mathbb E_\\infty$-群"}},{"Plain":"结构. 特别地, "},{"Local":{"url":"稳定同伦群","text":"稳定同伦群"}},{"Plain":" $\\pi_n^s(X)=\\pi_0\\operatorname{Hom}_s(S^n,X)$ 是 Abel 群.</p>\n<p>我们希望将"},{"Local":{"url":"生象","text":"生象"}},{"Plain":"的范畴"},{"Local":{"url":"稳定化","text":"稳定化"}},{"Plain":", 使得稳定化后的映射空间是上述的余极限, 也即形式上令 $\\Sigma$ 可逆. 参见"},{"Local":{"url":"形式取逆","text":"形式取逆"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>对于具有有限极限和有限余极限的范畴, 存在伴随 $\\Sigma \\dashv \\Omega$:\n$$\r\n\\text{Map}(\\Sigma X,Y)\\simeq *\\times_{\\text{Map}(X,Y)}*\\simeq \\text{Map}(X,\\Omega Y).\r\n$$</p>\n<p>谱的范畴 "},{"Local":{"url":"Sp","text":"$\\mathsf{Sp}$"}},{"Plain":" 是"},{"Local":{"url":"生象","text":"生象"}},{"Plain":"范畴的"},{"Local":{"url":"稳定化","text":"稳定化"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{Sp} := \\lim\\Big(\\cdots\\overset{\\Omega}{\\longrightarrow} \\mathsf{Ani}_*\r\n\\overset{\\Omega}{\\longrightarrow} \\mathsf{Ani}_*\\Big)\r\n\\in \\mathsf{Cat}_{\\infty}.\r\n$$\n其构造思路大致是: 从带基点"},{"Local":{"url":"生象","text":"生象"}},{"Plain":"范畴 $\\mathsf{Ani}_*$ 开始, 强行让"},{"Local":{"url":"纬悬","text":"纬悬"}},{"Plain":" $\\Sigma$ 变得可逆, 得到一个新的范畴.</p>\n<p>谱的"},{"Local":{"url":"数学对象的表现","text":"表现"}},{"Plain":"包括"},{"Local":{"url":"序列谱","text":"序列谱"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"坐标无关谱","text":"坐标无关谱"}},{"Plain":"等.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>见"},{"Local":{"url":"序列谱","text":"序列谱"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<h3>纬悬谱</h3>\n<p>设 $X$ 为带基点空间, $X$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"纬悬谱","text":"纬悬谱"}},{"Plain":" $\\Sigma^{\\infty}X$ 可定义为"},{"Local":{"url":"序列谱","text":"序列谱"}},{"Plain":" $\\{\\Sigma^q X\\}_{q\\geq 0}$ 以及恒等映射 $\\Sigma\\Sigma^q X\\to\\Sigma^{q+1}X$.</p>\n<p>对于正整数 $n$, 定义 $\\Sigma^{\\infty -n}X$ 为如下"},{"Local":{"url":"序列谱","text":"序列谱"}},{"Plain":": 第 $n$ 项以前为单点, 第 $q\\geq n$ 项为 $\\Sigma^{q-n}X$.</p>\n<p>特别地, 称 $X=S^0$ 的纬悬谱为"},{"Local":{"url":"球谱","text":"球谱"}},{"Plain":" (sphere spectrum).</p>\n<h3>谱化</h3>\n<p>对于预谱 $T_\\bullet$, 若 $T_q\\to \\Omega T_{q+1}$ 为嵌入, 可定义一个谱 $(LT)_\\bullet$,\n$$\r\n(LT)_q:=\\operatorname{colim}_{l}\\Omega^l T_{q+l},\r\n$$\n称为 $T$ 的谱化 (spectrification). 谱化是谱到预谱的遗忘的左伴随.</p>\n<p>特别地, 对于 $T=\\{\\Sigma^q X\\}_{q\\geq 0}$, 有 $(LT)_0=\\operatorname{colim}_l \\Omega^l\\Sigma^l X$, 记后者为 $QX$.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>谱的范畴 "},{"Local":{"url":"Sp","text":"$\\mathsf{Sp}$"}},{"Plain":" 是"},{"Local":{"url":"稳定无穷范畴","text":"稳定 ∞-范畴"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>有"},{"Local":{"url":"对称幺半∞-范畴","text":"对称幺半函子"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n(\\mathsf{Set},\\times) \\to (\\mathsf{Ani},\\times) \\overset{(-)_+}{\\to} (\\mathsf{Ani}_{*/},\\wedge) \\overset{\\Sigma_{\\infty}}{\\to} (\\mathsf{Sp},\\wedge).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>谱的同伦群与同调群</h2>\n<p>对于"},{"Local":{"url":"序列谱","text":"序列谱"}},{"Plain":" $T_\\bullet$, 定义\n$$\r\n\\pi_n(T_\\bullet)=\\operatorname{colim}_l \\pi_{n+l}T_l,\r\n$$\n$$\r\nH_n(T_\\bullet,R)=\\operatorname{colim}_q\\widetilde {H}_{n+q}(T_q,R).\r\n$$\n但这样无法定义上同调, 因为箭头的方向.</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"稳定化","text":"稳定化"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"稳定同伦范畴","text":"稳定同伦范畴"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"E∞-空间","text":"Abel ∞-群"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}